              <h3>Developing working relationships with other teams</h3>
<p>Let's take a look at why it is important to develop good relationships with other teams.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
          data-base="cp3_u1_s4_p1_working_relationships" 
          data-ext=".mp4" 
          data-multi="false"
          data-trans="cp3_u1_s4_p1_working_relationships undefined">
          <source src="https://kpcontent.blob.core.windows.net/$web/resources/v2l/720/cp3_u1_s4_p1_working_relationships.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          <track default label="English" kind="captions" srclang="en" src="~/videos/captions/vtt/cp3_u1_s4_p1_working_relationships.vtt">
